{"book":"Judges","chapter":7,"entries":[{"id":6695,"title":"Judges 7:1","segments":["¶Then Jerubbaal, who [is] Gideon, and all the people that [were] with him, rose up early, and pitched beside the well of Harod: so that the host of the Midianites were on the north side of them, by the hill of Moreh, in the valley."],"ref":"Judges 7:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶Then Jerubbaal","strong":"H3378"},{"text":", who [is] Gideon","strong":"H1439"},{"text":", and all the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" that [were] with him, rose up early","strong":"H7925"},{"text":", and pitched","strong":"H2583"},{"text":" beside the well of Harod","strong":"H5878"},{"text":": so that the host","strong":"H4264"},{"text":" of the Midianites","strong":"H4080"},{"text":" were on the north side","strong":"H6828"},{"text":" of them, by the hill","strong":"H1389"},{"text":" of Moreh","strong":"H4176"},{"text":", in the valley","strong":"H6010"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6696,"title":"Judges 7:2","segments":["And the LORD said unto Gideon, The people that [are] with thee [are] too many for me to give the Midianites into their hands, lest Israel vaunt themselves against me, saying, Mine own hand hath saved me."],"ref":"Judges 7:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Gideon","strong":"H1439"},{"text":", The people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" that [are] with thee [are] too many","strong":"H7227"},{"text":" for me to give","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" the Midianites","strong":"H4080"},{"text":" into their hands","strong":"H3027"},{"text":", lest Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" vaunt","strong":"H6286"},{"text":" themselves against me, saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Mine own hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":" hath saved","strong":"H3467"},{"text":" me."}]},{"id":6697,"title":"Judges 7:3","segments":["Now therefore go to, proclaim in the ears of the people, saying, Whosoever [is] fearful and afraid, let him return and depar